<section class="check-understanding"><exercise id="a6c9e4b8-a75e-4a58-9f4a-4e8de2a59766" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(y = -0.56x^2+ 38.74x + 5.31\)</para><para>\(y = -2.31x^2+ 24.711x + 3.25\)</para><para>\(y = -0.62x^2+ 17.45x + 9.64\)</para><para>\(y = -0.74x^2+ 34.32x + 7.44\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct!</para><para>Try again. Revisit activities 8.12.2.</para><para>The correct answer is \(y = -0.74x^2+ 34.32x + 7.44\).
     </para></solution></exercise></section><list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
