<section class="check-understanding"><exercise id="_0f36a607-99c7-4403-888f-af72446d761d" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(y = -6.3x^2+ 8x + 10.6\)</para><para>\(y = -3.1x^2+ 2.6x + 7.93\)</para><para>\(y = -4.31x^2+ 3.2x + 6.08\)</para><para>\(y = -5.1x^2 + 9.2x + 7.14\)</para></problem><solution><para>Correct!</para><para>Try again. Revisit activity 8.12.2.</para><para>The correct answer is \(y = -4.31x^2+ 3.2x + 6.08\).</para></solution></exercise></section><list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
